 comprar más","1 generación en ejecución o en cola","Todo lo que generas es público: la generación privada es de pago","Quitar el fondo: disponible, por 1 crédito","De pago: escalar, y en Studio Extend, Select area (antes Magic Fill) y Remix","Sin plan de pago, se descarga en JPEG a tamaño original; en PNG, sólo las imágenes transparentes y a 1K","Vídeo y modelos premium de otros proveedores: sólo con plan de pago o créditos comprados","Plan de pago más barato: Plus, 20 $/mes (15 $/mes en anual), 2.400 créditos al mes"],"requiresSignup":"yes","requiresCreditCard":"unverified","hasWatermark":"unverified","commercialUse":"yes","creditReset":"weekly","verifiedAt":"2026-10-11","excludedCapabilities":["upscaling"],"creditsAmount":"30 créditos/semana","includedCapabilities":[{"capability":"text-to-image","evidence":{"outcome":"stated","checkedAt":"2026-10-11","scope":"product","sourceUrl":"https://docs.ideogram.ai/create/models","sourceKind":"docs","quote":"Every plan, free included, can use Auto and all Ideogram models."}},{"capability":"image-to-image","condition":"6 créditos por imagen","evidence":{"outcome":"stated","checkedAt":"2026-10-11","scope":"product","sourceUrl":"https://docs.ideogram.ai/edit/remix","sourceKind":"docs","quote":"[Tabla «You can remix in two places»] Remix app — Plan: Any plan (6 credits per image) · Remix in Studio — Plan: Paid plan"}},{"capability":"background-removal","evidence":{"outcome":"stated","checkedAt":"2026-10-11","scope":"product","sourceUrl":"https://docs.ideogram.ai/create/transparent-backgrounds","sourceKind":"docs","quote":"[Tabla: Way · Best when · Plan] Remove BG afterwards · You already have the image · Free and paid"}}]},"capabilities":["text-to-image","image-to-image","image-editing","inpainting","outpainting","reference-image","character-consistency","upscaling","background-removal","api"],"start_effort":"signup","start_effort_reason":"Pide iniciar sesión antes de generar; los créditos van asociados a la cuenta.","scores":