re tu repositorio, te devuelve uno. Los créditos diarios con tope mensual son una forma poco común de racionar, y conviene leerla antes de planificar una tarde.","free_plan":{"summary":"Plan gratuito con cinco créditos de construcción al día, hasta un máximo de treinta al mes. Incluye veinte créditos de nube mensuales y cuatro créditos utilizables por las funciones de IA integradas en las aplicaciones que generes.","limits":["5 créditos de construcción al día (máximo 30 al mes)","Se renuevan cada día a las 00:00 UTC y no se acumulan","20 créditos de nube al mes","4 créditos para las funciones de IA de tus aplicaciones"],"requiresSignup":"yes","requiresCreditCard":"no","hasWatermark":"unverified","commercialUse":"yes","creditsAmount":"5 créditos/día (tope de 30/mes)","creditReset":"daily","verifiedAt":"2026-10-11","includedCapabilities":[{"capability":"code-generation","condition":"5 créditos de construcción al día, hasta 30 al mes","evidence":{"outcome":"stated","checkedAt":"2026-10-11","scope":"product","sourceUrl":"https://docs.lovable.dev/introduction/credits-and-usage","sourceKind":"docs","quote":"[Tabla «Included usage-specific grants by plan»] Free · Daily chat allowance: Included · Daily build credits: 5 per day, up to 30 per month · Monthly Cloud grant: 20 credits per month · Monthly AI grant: 4 credits per month"}}]},"capabilities":["code-generation","integrations"],"start_effort":"signup","start_effort_reason":"Se describe lo que quieres en el navegador; no hace falta instalar nada.","scores":{"freeReal":6,"usefulness":8,"ease":9,"transparency":8,"creatorValue":7},"sources":[{"url":"https://lovable.dev/","label":"Web oficial","kind":"official","publisher":"lovable.dev","checkedAt":"2026-08-21"},{"url":"https://lovable.dev/pricing","label":"Precios oficiales","kind":"pricing","publisher":"lovable.dev","checkedAt":"2026-10-11"},{"url":"https://docs.lovable.dev/user-guides/messaging-limits","label":"Documentación oficial","kind":"docs","publisher":"docs.lovab